        EXCHANGE IN DISTR
          EXCHANGE OUT DISTR (HASH)
            EXPANSION
              SUBPLAN SCAN s
                PX PARTITION ITERATOR
                  MERGE JOIN
                    TABLE FULL SCAN r
                    TABLE FULL SCAN l

连续执行 16 次，11 次出现单表与 CTE JOIN 重构表的 ROLLUP 汇总代表值不同；普通分组行始终一致。


首先计算 GREATEST(vp_rowid, c0)

此时 vp_rowid 与 c0 并非来自任何确定的分组，而是取自某个“残留”行（可能是扫描到的第一行、最后一行或并行分片中的某一行）

由于 GREATEST 返回值非空，IFNULL 直接返回了该值（1 或 2），导致汇总行实际携带了某个普通分组的值

根因是 OceanBase 对 WITH ROLLUP 超级聚合行的分组表达式求值存在逻辑错误：当分组表达式为包含非聚合列的 IFNULL(GREATEST(...), ...) 形式时，汇总行并未强制将整个表达式置为 NULL，而是对内部标量表达式进行了依赖具体行数据的计算，导致汇总行结果不确定且与普通分组行值冲突。该行为违反了 SQL 标准对 ROLLUP 的语义规定，属于内核缺陷。

SELECT *
FROM (
  SELECT /*+ PARALLEL(4) */ DISTINCT
    BIT_OR(vp_rowid) AS b,
    ((0.67 || c0) <= vp_rowid) AS g1,
    (((vp_rowid != c1) > -1) >= CAST(c0 IS FALSE AS SIGNED)) AS g2
  FROM jt
  GROUP BY
    ((0.67 || c0) <= vp_rowid),
    (((vp_rowid != c1) > -1) >= CAST(c0 IS FALSE AS SIGNED))
  WITH ROLLUP
) AS t
ORDER BY g1, g2;

SELECT *
FROM (
  SELECT /*+ PARALLEL(4) */ DISTINCT
    BIT_OR(vp_rowid) AS b,
    ((0.67 || c0) <= vp_rowid) AS g1,
    (((vp_rowid != c1) > -1) >= CAST(c0 IS FALSE AS SIGNED)) AS g2
  FROM src
  GROUP BY
    ((0.67 || c0) <= vp_rowid),
    (((vp_rowid != c1) > -1) >= CAST(c0 IS FALSE AS SIGNED))
  WITH ROLLUP
) AS t
ORDER BY g1, g2;

SELECT *
FROM (
  SELECT /*+ PARALLEL(4) */ DISTINCT
    BIT_OR(vp_rowid) AS b,
    ((0.67 || c0) <= vp_rowid) AS g1,
    (((vp_rowid != c1) > -1) >= CAST(c0 IS FALSE AS SIGNED)) AS g2
  FROM jt
  GROUP BY
    ((0.67 || c0) <= vp_rowid),
    (((vp_rowid != c1) > -1) >= CAST(c0 IS FALSE AS SIGNED))
  WITH ROLLUP
) AS t
ORDER BY g1, g2;